o-flag ro-flag-rec">Fits at 5&times;</span> Fits at <b>5&times;</b> (the full published size). One multiple draws down <b>$1,600</b> at worst (best window); 5&times; uses about <b>$7,998</b> of a $50k budget. Expected average monthly profit at 5&times;: <b class="ro-ret">&asymp;$15,042</b> (best window, 8 months; $3,008 per multiple). Past results, not a forecast. This budget exceeds the published 5&times; size; we do not recommend raising the Multiplier beyond it &mdash; profit and drawdown rise together.</div></div>
